    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/a534ad36fe4190b61f62e54b9282735b.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Space Travellers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel throughout the solar system based on Kepler's realistic laws of gravity. Invent your own routes between planets, use gravity, trade, complete missions and upgrade your spaceship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/251781131c7ed582271ca292c26634f8.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=364 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you'll find in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains the entire solar system, processed to the smallest detail. Use the mutual gravity of the bodies to travel and save precious fuel to travel between bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/d7ed4e4b7cd52c3b24ea6aff2fdc6be2.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet can be landed on and fully explored. Trade, upgrade your spaceship and enjoy free movement in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/9ad238985b9a23875b03eb37f473693f.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no loading screens in the game! The game has no limits! Explore the whole solar system smoothly and without waiting and recording!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/a534ad36fe4190b61f62e54b9282735b.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Space Travellers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel throughout the solar system based on Kepler's realistic laws of gravity. Invent your own routes between planets, use gravity, trade, complete missions and upgrade your spaceship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/251781131c7ed582271ca292c26634f8.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=364 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you'll find in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains the entire solar system, processed to the smallest detail. Use the mutual gravity of the bodies to travel and save precious fuel to travel between bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/d7ed4e4b7cd52c3b24ea6aff2fdc6be2.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet can be landed on and fully explored. Trade, upgrade your spaceship and enjoy free movement in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270410/extras/9ad238985b9a23875b03eb37f473693f.avif?t=1744318949\" data-has-big width=800 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no loading screens in the game! The game has no limits! Explore the whole solar system smoothly and without waiting and recording!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
